\* All TLC check configs for AntflyPromotionOwnerHandoff.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive tier=fast
\* TLC config for AntflyPromotionOwnerHandoff.tla.

SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyAttachBeforeDetach = FALSE
    BuggyPromoteWithoutOwnership = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    AtMostOneAttachedOwner
    AttachedImpliesRangeOwner
    NoUnownedPromotion
    Safety

PROPERTIES
    NewSideEventuallyOwns

==== BadAttachBeforeDetach
\* Expected-failure config: the child/receiver installs its promotion owner
\* while the parent/donor is still attached. Pinned to single-owner
\* exclusivity.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyAttachBeforeDetach = TRUE
    BuggyPromoteWithoutOwnership = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    AtMostOneAttachedOwner

==== BadAttachBeforeTransfer
\* Expected-failure config: same premature-attach mutant, pinned to the
\* range-ownership coupling — the new side attaches after the handoff began
\* but before the range actually transferred.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyAttachBeforeDetach = TRUE
    BuggyPromoteWithoutOwnership = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    AttachedImpliesRangeOwner

==== BadPromoteUnowned
\* Expected-failure config: the promotion catch-up loop advances without the
\* isLocalOwner ownership predicate. Pinned to the no-unowned-promotion
\* invariant.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyAttachBeforeDetach = FALSE
    BuggyPromoteWithoutOwnership = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    NoUnownedPromotion
